  "label": "political activists",
  "description": "The meme is designed for individuals engaged in or supportive of political activism, particularly those involved in movements seeking regime change. The visual of the authoritative-looking man and the text 'keep it up and you'll get some regime change' serve as motivational messaging aimed at encouraging sustained political engagement. The target audience is likely those who believe in the efficacy of persistent protest or advocacy to achieve political transformation, and who identify with or support anti-establishment or revolutionary causes.",
